OL,3,GNorth East                             
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FCloudy but   
OL,6,Fremaining dry across most areas,       
OL,7,Falthough a few coastal showers are     
OL,8,Fpossible. Turning chilly, with a frost 
OL,9,Fpossible over the Cheviot Hills. The   
OL,10,Fwind remains light inland, but become  
OL,11,Fbreezy along the coast.                
OL,13,CThursday:FRather cloudy through        
OL,14,FThursday, with a few showers           
OL,15,Finitially, mainly towards the coast.   
OL,16,FBecoming increasingly cloudy as the    
OL,17,Fday progresses, with rain moving in    
OL,18,Fovernight. Cold, with frost developing 
OL,19,Fovernight.                             
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
