OL,3,GNorth East                             
OL,5,COutlook for Friday to Sunday:FCloudy   
OL,6,Fon Friday, with rain and hill snow,    
OL,7,Fturning cold overnight. Dull on        
OL,8,FSaturday, with outbreaks of heavy      
OL,9,Frain. Becoming brighter by Sunday      
OL,10,Fmorning, but with afternoon showers to 
OL,11,Ffollow.                                
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
